  "status_text": "Twenty-two helper switches can shrink a rulebook from over thirty-three million lines to sixty-four. Lean checked the game on 25 pairs of lights. Accept if some pair has both lights on. With only the visible switches, the smallest AND-of-ORs formula takes 33,554,432 clauses, even with negated inputs allowed. With 22 helpers, an input is accepted if some setting of the helpers satisfies all the clauses. Lean checked a formula with at most 64 clauses, each containing at most three literals (L-lib-1117).",
